{"candidateAnswer":"Shortbread cookies","evidence":"[D3:3 | 3:55 pm on 6 June, 2023] Evan: That salad looks yummy! I'm being extra careful with my health lately. I'm trying to eat less processed food and sugary snacks, even though I love ginger snaps. Have you made any changes to your diet recently?\n[D5:5 | 7:52 pm on 7 August, 2023] Evan: Ginger snaps are my weakness for sure! Dealing with health issues has been tough, but it's made me appreciate the good moments more. These are the ones who bring lots of joy even through the hard times.\n[D23:15 | 1:32 pm on 6 January, 2024] Evan: Thanks, Sam! We're having a family get-together tonight and enjoying some homemade lasagna. Super excited! By the way, I've started a new diet—limiting myself to just two ginger snaps a day. What's on your menu tonight?\t\n[D22:12 | 11:00 am on 31 December, 2023] Evan: Exactly! They’re packed with nutrients and really easy to make. You also need to try these cookies, they are awesome! I’ll send you the recipes.","itemId":"urn:uuid:637e00ae-455d-54f6-9bfb-26dea057ca2b","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:9da2a25adaf22992d645e7227b33ba0f29b8fe29e2e7add3faa25df027d9af00","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What is Evan's favorite food?","referenceAnswer":"Ginger snaps","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"9da2a25adaf22992d645e7227b33ba0f29b8fe29e2e7add3faa25df027d9af00"}}]}